+/* Fixed size hash table with internal linking.
+   Copyright (C) 2000, 2001, 2002, 2004, 2005 Red Hat, Inc.
+   This file is part of elfutils.
+   Written by Ulrich Drepper <drepper@redhat.com>, 2000.
