@@ -0,0 +1,66 @@
+/* Get string.
+   Copyright (C) 2004 Red Hat, Inc.
+   This file is part of elfutils.
+   Written by Ulrich Drepper <drepper@redhat.com>, 2004.
+
+   This file is free software; you can redistribute it and/or modify
