@@ -0,0 +1,74 @@
+/* Read header of next archive member.
+   Copyright (C) 1998, 1999, 2000, 2002, 2008 Red Hat, Inc.
+   This file is part of elfutils.
+   Written by Ulrich Drepper <drepper@redhat.com>, 1998.
